  "details": "You guys said once that chatboxes are somehow a moderation issue? \nI believe text is way less in your face as voice is, and you do not mute everyone by default until they change a setting do you...\n\nIt makes no sense to make the chatboxes friends only as default, this only causes the chatboxes not being used as they should be used to communicate that's literally the reason we want chatboxes for.\nThere will always be people TALKING and writing toxic things, you cannot avoid this so don't even try just make your vote kick system work better and give out banns for bad behavior.\nChange to default everyone.",
